/* Gp078 - ShapeFix_Edge.FixSameParameter near-degenerate
 * Defect: 3D curve approaches but doesn't reach zero length (tiny but non-zero);
 * FixSameParameter's degenerate-edge check uses Confusion but curve is just above it */
HEADER;
